_to_delete/

# --- lockfiles -------------------------------------------------------------
# The root lockfile is REQUIRED: `npm ci` (CI + EAS) refuses to run without
# it, and EAS builds must be reproducible. Nested lockfiles stay ignored so
# deploy/ keeps its current `npm install` behaviour on Vercel.
package-lock.json
!/package-lock.json

# --- mobile / shared (from protein-outfitters-app) -------------------------
dist/
build/
.expo/
.expo-shared/
*.tsbuildinfo
mobile/ios/
mobile/android/
*.xcworkspace
*.xcodeproj

# Env / secrets — NEVER commit
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
mobile/play-store-service-account.json

# Logs / editors / coverage
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
coverage/
